        <div facs="#eSc_textblock_8c5449e6">
            <ab><lb /><hi rendition="#g2"><seg type="slogan">THE MASTER'S FINGERS ON YOUR PIANO</seg></hi></ab>
         </div>

        <div facs="#eSc_textblock_d27998d8" type="illustration">
            <figure>
                <desc resp="#np">Portrait of Paderewski</desc>
            </figure>
            <p>
                <lb />
                <persName type="artist" corresp="https://d-nb.info/gnd/118986724">IGNACE PADEREWSKI</persName>
            </p>
        </div>

        <div facs="#eSc_textblock_daee394a" type="illustration">
            <figure>
                <desc resp="#np">Portrait of Casella</desc>
            </figure>
            <p>
                <lb />
                <persName type="artist" corresp="https://d-nb.info/gnd/119362112">ALFREDO CASELLA</persName>
            </p>
        </div>

        <div facs="#eSc_textblock_f4aeb73c" type="illustration">
            <lb />
            <figure>
                <desc resp="#np">Portrait of Pachmann</desc>
            </figure>
            <p>
                <lb />
                <persName type="artist" corresp="https://d-nb.info/gnd/116014490">VLADIMIR DE PACHMANN</persName>
            </p>
        </div>

        <div facs="#eSc_textblock_7b9c80a0" type="illustration">
            <figure>
                <desc resp="#np">Portrait of Gieseking</desc>
            </figure>
            <p>
                <lb />
                <persName type="artist" corresp="https://d-nb.info/gnd/118694820">WALTER GIESEKING</persName>
            </p>
        </div>

        <div facs="#eSc_textblock_80aa6210" type="illustration">
            <ab><seg xml:id="topic_1" ana="#phantom_body" resp="#np" type="topic">
                <desc>
                    Phantom hands
                </desc>
            </seg></ab>
        </div>

        <div facs="#eSc_textblock_d4f05f93">
            <ab><lb /><hi rendition="#smaller"><hi rendition="#dropcap">T</hi></hi>HE genius of <persName type="artist" corresp="https://d-nb.info/gnd/118986724">Paderewski</persName>,
            <lb /><persName type="artist" corresp="https://d-nb.info/gnd/116014490">de Pachmann</persName>,
            <persName type="artist" corresp="https://d-nb.info/gnd/119362112">Casella</persName> and
            <lb /><persName type="artist" corresp="https://d-nb.info/gnd/118694820">Gieseking</persName> lives
            forever through
            <lb />the magic of the <name type="brand">Welte-Mignon
            <lb />Licensee Reproducing Action</name>.
            <lb />Only <name type="brand">Welte-Mignon Licensee</name>
            <lb />
            <seg xml:id="topic_2" ana="#secret" resp="#np" type="topic">
               possesses the secret
            </seg>
            of
            <seg xml:id="topic_3" ana="#exact_reproduction" resp="#np" type="topic">
               perfect
               <lb />reproduction
            </seg>.
            <lb />Through
            <name type="brand">Welte-Mignon Li-
            <lb />censee</name> the playing of the world's
            <lb />greatest pianists is
            <seg xml:id="topic_4" ana="#home" type="topic" resp="#np">
                brought to
                <lb />your home
            </seg>, flawless, magnificent,
            <lb />its glory undimmed.
            <lb />You can have <name type="brand">Welte-Mignon
            <lb />Licensee</name> in 115 different pianos.
            <lb />The famous <name type="brand">Welte-Mignon
            Li-
            <lb />censee Reproducing Action</name> can be
            <lb />installed in your own grand piano.
            <lb />There are <name type="brand">Welte-Mignon Li-
            <lb />censee</name> dealers everywhere. Send
            <lb />for a copy of our
            beautiful book-
            <lb />let containing portraits of the
            <lb />great artists.
            <hi rendition="#c"><lb />THE <orgName>AUTO PNEUMATIC ACTION CO.</orgName></hi>
            <hi rendition="#c #smaller"><lb /><persName>W. C. Heaton, <hi rendition="#i">President</hi></persName>
            <lb />
            <address>
                <addrLine>653 West 51st Street, New York,
                N. Y.</addrLine>
            </address></hi></ab>
        </div>

        <div facs="#eSc_textblock_66f64898">
            <ab><hi rendition="#c"><lb />
            <seg xml:id="topic_5" ana="#superiority">
                The superiority of any reproducing piano
                <lb />is assured if it contains the
                <lb />
                <name type="brand">
                  <hi rendition="#in #larger"><hi rendition="#in">Welte-Mignon</hi></hi>
                  <lb /><hi rendition="#i #g2 #smaller"><hi rendition="#smaller">LICENSEE</hi></hi>
                  <lb />reproducing action
                </name>
            </seg></hi></ab>
        </div>
